  "releaseNotes": "Cross.Identity: identity and authentication flows, JWT, process engine.\n\nBreaking changes: https://github.com/denis-peshkov/Cross.Identity/blob/master/docs/BREAKING.md\n\nLicensing\n- JWT license validation (Peshkov software) on first IFlowExecutor.ExecuteAsync call.\n- Configure via CrossIdentity:LicenseKey in appsettings or CrossIdentity__LicenseKey environment variable.\n\nAlso: External OAuth, refresh-token AbsoluteExpiresAt / rotation, DeveloperMode codes, VerifyToken flow.",
